  "verse": 15,
  "translation": "Now if you are ready, that at the time you hear the sound of the horn, the pipe, the lyre, the trigon, the psaltery, and the symphony, and all kinds of music, you fall down and worship the image that I have made — but if you do not worship, in that moment you shall be cast into the midst of a furnace of burning fire; and who is the Elah that shall deliver you out of my hands?",
